WEBVTT

NOTE
Galbadia Missile Base destroyed — the self-destruct detonation.
Duration: approximately 15 seconds.

00:00.000 --> 00:02.600
Fire erupts behind the missile launchers.

00:03.130 --> 00:05.300
The base begins to detonate.

00:07.670 --> 00:13.320
A colossal column of dust and debris blasts up from the desert.
